OL,3,GNEWSA'Mum's youth club helped make my
OL,4,Amusic dream a reality'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Isaac Paris Spence was a teenager,
OL,7,Fhe dreamt of becoming a musician but
OL,8,Ffelt he did not have the right guidance
OL,9,Fto make it happen.
OL,11,FHis mother, Diane Spence, wanted to
OL,12,Fchange that and set herself a goal. To
OL,13,Fopen doors for Isaac and other local
OL,14,Fyoung black people, and to transform
OL,15,Frepresentation in the workplace.
OL,17,F"My son lived in an area which was
OL,18,Fquite isolated for him; it was a space
OL,19,Fwhere he didn't see people that looked
OL,20,Flike him," Diane said.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
